culator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. On that middle, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025, November to December finished at 40% of normal and October to November at 72%. Grid 16678 had its driest year in 2007 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
